[outcome]: Agree on an outcome
[project]: Assign project ownership
[milestone]: Define an acceptance gate
[issue]: Deliver and review issues
[note]: Record decisions and evidence
[review]: Accept or revise the milestone
[outcome] -> [project]
[project] -> [milestone]
[milestone] -> [issue]
[issue] -> [note]
[note] -> [review]
[review] --> [milestone]: revise scope
